  "completed_experiments_and_plan_departures": {
    "completed_experiments": [
      "Phase 1 (22/22 jobs DONE, 617 PUBs, 538,112 physical shots, 149.0s IBM + 47.25 IQM credits): Stage 0 pilot, Stage 1A/1B 6-policy unseen queue comparison, Stage 2A/2B multi-window and cross-QPU routing across ibm_kingston, ibm_fez, ibm_marrakesh, emerald, and garnet, Stage 3A/3B duration-mismatch experiments, Stage 4A/4B fixed-shot 4x spatial-replica comparison, and Stage 5A live fault/failover and timeout reconciliation.",
      "Phase 2A (12/12 standalone policy jobs DONE, 143 PUBs, 125,952 physical shots, 43.0s IBM Account C + 14.25 IQM credits): Directly billed standalone policy jobs in randomized order under hard submission caps (28 PUBs IBM, 8 PUBs IQM).",
      "Phase 2D (10/10 prospective shot-ladder + independent confirmation jobs DONE, 240 PUBs, 233,472 physical shots, 42.0s IBM Account C + 41.25 IQM credits): Fresh prospective shot rungs (256, 512, 1024, 2048) plus independent 1,024-shot confirmation job, reporting both predeclared stopping-rule cost-to-target and actual full-ladder campaign expenditure.",
      "Phase 2C (3/3 disjoint shared-PUB cluster jobs DONE, 110 PUBs, 84,992 physical shots, 18.0s IBM Account B + 15.75 IQM credits): K = 8 (df = 7) strictly disjoint 8-workload clusters on ibm_kingston and K = 6 (df = 5) 4-Way / K = 12 (df = 11) 2-Way strictly disjoint clusters on emerald with zero workload reuse.",
      "Phase 2B (3/3 jobs DONE across IBM ibm_kingston, IQM emerald, and IQM garnet, 136 PUBs, 98,304 physical shots, 18.0s IBM Account A + 14.25 IQM credits): 4-arm calibration freshness vs. donor/geometry factorial with Q_B4(w) == Q_B2(w) enforced across 100% of workloads."
    ],
    "documented_departures_from_plan": [
      "Phase 1 Stage 1 Budget Cutoffs vs. Phase 2A Standalone Jobs: Phase 1 evaluated 30-PUB (IBM) and 8-PUB (IQM) limits as post-hoc cutoffs with pro-rata job costs; Phase 2A resolved this by executing 12 standalone policy jobs with separate provider billing under randomized order.",
      "Phase 1 Stage 2 Joint Compiler+Placement vs. Phase 2B 4-Arm Factorial: Both previously pending Phase 1 cross-QPU jobs (ibm_fez and ibm_marrakesh) completed and are harvested; Phase 2B added a 4-arm factorial separating same-QPU calibration freshness (B4 - B3), compiler routing on identical physical qubits (B4 - B2 with Q_B4 == Q_B2 enforced), and live vs. geometry/donor subgraph placement (B2 - B1). All three Phase 2B jobs (ibm_kingston dboalms4148s73927590, emerald 01a1bc1b-9b37-76a4-9584-d4e594c99826, and garnet 01a1bc1b-cc14-7434-9573-6578f6af6712) are DONE and harvested.",
      "Phase 1 Stage 3 Shared-PUB Clusters vs. Phase 2C Disjoint Clusters: Phase 2C expanded the shared-PUB cluster count to K = 8 (df = 7) on IBM and K = 6 (df = 5, 4-Way) / K = 12 (df = 11, 2-Way) on IQM with zero workload reuse, certifying both IBM M1 vs. M0a non-inferiority (p_NI = 3.1e-5) and IQM M1 vs. M4 wait-loss recovery superiority (two-sided p = 0.0163 for 4-Way, p = 0.0052 for 2-Way).",
      "Phase 1 Stage 4 Fixed-Shot Replica Comparison vs. Phase 2D Prospective Shot Ladder: Phase 2D executed all 4 prospective shot rungs (256, 512, 1024, 2048) plus an independent 1,024-shot confirmation job across 10 hardware jobs, explicitly reporting both Predeclared Stopping-Rule Cost-to-Target and Actual Full-Ladder Campaign Expenditure."
    ]
  },
